= Saskatchewan Association of Rural Municipalities

One of the local levels of government are the RM's or Rural Municipalities. They oversee municipal functions in the sparsely populated areas of the province such as local infrastructure, public safety, and land use. 

SARM is a collective of RM's united to serve the broader interests of the Rural municipalities.

- @fund_rms: Let's provide additional funding to the Rural Municipalities
- @rm_cooperatives: Provide financial backing for RM's supporting Cooperatives
- @root: Return to main

@fund_rms
title: RM Funding
subtitle: Improve our standing among rural citizens
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and financial_minister_party = ccf_name
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] 
on-arrival: farmers_ccf += 2; 

We have increased funding to the RM's. This increases our relationship with the SARM who may well endorse us in the next general election. 

@rm_cooperatives
title: RM Cooperatives
subtitle: Increases presence of Cooperatives
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: economic_data.retail.coop += 0.05; economic_data.retail.private -= 0.05

We are incentivizing the RM's to provide backing for cooperatives. 
